[2026-01-30T15:14:48.689Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_01MS2t2JDCKnzFFNQSVVdox9","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Implementation complete. Here's a summary:\n\n## Summary: Unified Graph Visualization Primitive\n\n**Created `src/components/report/visualizations/GraphVisualization.tsx`** - A unified graph visualization component that accepts nodes/edges data and a rendering strategy as props.\n\n### Key Features:\n\n**Types:**\n- `GraphNode` - Node with id, label, type, value, color, and arbitrary data\n- `GraphEdge` - Edge with source, target, strength, type (default/dashed/dotted), label\n- `GraphLayoutStrategy` - Union of 'force-directed' | 'concentric' | 'radial' | 'tree' | 'grid'\n- `GraphLayoutOptions` - Discriminated union with strategy-specific options\n\n**Layout Strategies:**\n1. **force-directed** - Physics-based layout using existing `useForceLayout` hook\n2. **concentric** - Radial rings using existing `useConcentricLayoutNodes` hook  \n3. **radial** - Orbital/constellation layout with grouping (like EntityConstellation)\n4. **tree** - Horizontal tree layout for hierarchical data\n5. **grid** - Simple grid layout\n\n**Props:**\n- `nodes`, `edges` - Graph data\n- `layout` - Strategy and options\n- `onNodeClick`, `onNodeHover`, `onEdgeClick` - Interaction callbacks\n- `selectedNodeId`, `highlightedNodeId` - Selection state\n- `showLabels`, `showGrid`, `showLegend` - Display options\n- `centerLabel` - Optional center content\n- `renderNode` - Custom node renderer for full customization\n\n**Benefits:**\n- Reuses existing layout hooks from `@/src/lib/layout`\n- Consistent interaction patterns across all graph visualizations\n- Theme-aware with `useVisualizationTheme`\n- Custom node rendering support for specialized needs\n- Type-safe with discriminated union for layout options\n\n**Updated `src/components/report/visualizations/index.tsx`** to export the new component and its types."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":268,"cache_read_input_tokens":149483,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":268},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"063d9692-0974-4418-8890-3933b0ef315a","uuid":"4e802649-2a22-4805-836d-58e3021348d3"}
